hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"220","[AI-translation] Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh akela hai, beshareek. Badshahat usi ki hai, tareef usi ki hai; zinda karta hai aur maut deta hai; woh zinda hai, marta nahin; bhalai us ke hath mein hai; woh har cheez par qadir hai. [Bazaar mein dakhil hokar padhe]"
